{
  "description": "Block E (ADR-DISCOVERY-086): the verification chain (ADR-085) on biomedical hypotheses: (a) the pTau217 two-cutoff rule and three variants, (b) the three rivals of the Alzheimer formal scenario, (c) a mechanistic chain from prose and three variants. Illustrative values only, not clinical values. Every number is a placeholder chosen to exercise a check; none is a clinical value.",
  "cases": {
    "ptau217_cutoff": {
      "note": "(a) The pTau217 two-cutoff rule, restated for the chain: the separation of the biomarker is the claim (the empirical premise), ordered cutoffs and preserved renal clearance are assumptions, and the rule-out and rule-in guarantees are consequences. Units in ng/L; the cited cutoff entry is in pg/mL (the same unit). Illustrative values only, not clinical values.",
      "request": {
        "hypothesis": {
          "hypothesis_id": "PTAU217-TWO-CUTOFF",
          "statement": "With preserved renal clearance and ordered cutoffs, plasma pTau217 separates amyloid-PET negative from positive people, so the two-cutoff rule rules out below c_low and rules in above c_high.",
          "variables": [
            {
              "name": "c_low",
              "continuous": true
            },
            {
              "name": "c_high",
              "continuous": true
            },
            {
              "name": "ptau_val",
              "continuous": true
            },
            {
              "name": "amyloid_pet",
              "continuous": true
            },
            {
              "name": "egfr",
              "continuous": true
            },
            {
              "name": "true_pathology",
              "continuous": true
            },
            {
              "name": "clearance_factor",
              "continuous": true
            }
          ],
          "scope": "(c_low > 0) and (c_high > 0) and (ptau_val >= 0) and (amyloid_pet == 0 or amyloid_pet == 1) and (egfr > 0) and (clearance_factor > 0) and ((egfr >= 60) or (clearance_factor > 1.0))",
          "assumptions": [
            "c_low < c_high",
            "clearance_factor == 1"
          ],
          "claims": [
            "((amyloid_pet != 0) or ((ptau_val / clearance_factor) <= c_low)) and ((amyloid_pet != 1) or ((ptau_val / clearance_factor) >= c_high))"
          ]
        },
        "rivals": [
          {
            "hypothesis_id": "PTAU217-SEPARATION-WITHOUT-CLEARANCE",
            "statement": "The same separation, on the measured value, ignoring renal clearance.",
            "variables": [
              {
                "name": "c_low",
                "continuous": true
              },
              {
                "name": "c_high",
                "continuous": true
              },
              {
                "name": "ptau_val",
                "continuous": true
              },
              {
                "name": "amyloid_pet",
                "continuous": true
              },
              {
                "name": "egfr",
                "continuous": true
              },
              {
                "name": "true_pathology",
                "continuous": true
              },
              {
                "name": "clearance_factor",
                "continuous": true
              }
            ],
            "scope": "(c_low > 0) and (c_high > 0) and (ptau_val >= 0) and (amyloid_pet == 0 or amyloid_pet == 1) and (egfr > 0) and (clearance_factor > 0) and ((egfr >= 60) or (clearance_factor > 1.0))",
            "claims": [
              "((amyloid_pet != 0) or (ptau_val <= c_low)) and ((amyloid_pet != 1) or (ptau_val >= c_high))"
            ],
            "assumptions": [
              "c_low < c_high"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "consequences": [
          "(ptau_val > c_low) or (amyloid_pet == 0)",
          "(ptau_val < c_high) or (amyloid_pet == 1)"
        ],
        "citations": [
